    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-07-22",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><b>Plain Prescription Prices Act</b></p> <p>This bill requires the Centers for Medicare &amp; Medicaid Services to issue a rule requiring direct-to-consumer television advertisements for prescription drugs that are covered by Medicare or Medicaid to include a textual statement of the drug's list price.</p>",
